        ["qasem-soleimani","Qasem Soleimani","1957–2020","Qanat-e Malek, Kerman Province, Iran","Baghdad, Iraq","Major general; Quds Force commander","Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps","Soleimani joined the Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps after the 1979 revolution and served in the Iran-Iraq War.","He led the IRGC Quds Force and Iran's external operations; he was killed in a U.S. airstrike in Baghdad in 2020.","A consequential and controversial figure in Iran's regional policy and modern Middle Eastern conflicts.","iran-comanders/qasem-soleimani.jpg","https://www.britannica.com/biography/Qasem-Soleimani"]
